cket set?","ar":"ما هو طقم المفاتيح؟"},"subHold":6.443,"id":"L007"},{"actor":"nabil","start":40.609,"text":{"en":"A box of round tool heads for different bolts.","ar":"صندوق فيه رؤوس مستديرة لبراغي مختلفة."},"id":"L008"},{"actor":"nabil","start":44.391,"text":{"en":"What is a ratchet?","ar":"ما هو مفتاح السقّاطة؟"},"subHold":6.027,"id":"L009"},{"actor":"nabil","start":50.418,"text":{"en":"A handle that turns a socket one way.","ar":"مقبض يدوّر الرأس في اتّجاه واحد."},"id":"L010"},{"actor":"nabil","start":53.768,"text":{"en":"What does a torque wrench do?","ar":"ماذا يفعل مفتاح العزم؟"},"subHold":7.13,"id":"L011"},{"actor":"nabil","start":60.898,"text":{"en":"It tightens a bolt to the exact level.","ar":"يشدّ البرغي إلى الحدّ المضبوط."},"id":"L012"},{"actor":"nabil","start":64.176,"text":{"en":"What is a trolley jack?","ar":"ما هي الرافعة المتحرّكة؟"},"subHold":6.585,"id":"L013"},{"actor":"nabil","start":70.761,"text":{"en":"A wheeled tool that lifts the car.","ar":"أداة بعجلات ترفع السيارة."},"id":"L014"},{"actor":"nabil","start":73.823,"text":{"en":"What is an axle stand?","ar":"ما هو حامل المحور؟"},"subHold":6.694,"id":"L015"},{"actor":"nabil","start":80.517,"text":{"en":"A strong metal stand that holds the car up safely.","ar":"حامل معدني قويّ يسند السيارة بأمان."},"id":"L016"},{"actor":"nabil","start":84.491,"text":{"en":"And what is a wheel chock?","ar":"وما هو صادّ العجلة؟"},"subHold":6.906,"id":"L017"},{"actor":"nabil","start":91.397,"text":{"en":"A block that stops a wheel from rolling.","ar":"قطعة تمنع العجلة من التدحرج."},"id":"L018"},{"actor":"tarek","start":94.723,"text":{"en":"One meaning was not needed: a rubber pipe that carries a fluid. That is a hose, from Unit 2.","ar":"معنى واحد لم يكن مطلوباً: أنبوب مطّاطي ينقل سائلاً. ذلك خرطوم، من الوحدة الثانية."},"id":"L019"}],"subtitles":{"enabled":true,"langs":"en,ar","show":null,"lang":{}},"badgePlacement":{"x":"0.016","y":"0.016","width":"0.205"},"audio":{"master":"audio.m4a","lines":[{"key":"4408308ca3bf